{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16110361","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16110361","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1611036101:0":{"text":"그로웬...","source_cn":"格墨文……<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE31D59F415A8DF3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1611036102:0":{"text":"여기까지 왔는데 아직도 네 다리가 다 나았다는 사실을 숨길 셈이야?","source_cn":"事已至此，你还要隐瞒你的腿伤已经痊愈的事实吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89F70C0B31C4B798","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1611036103:0":{"text":"그것 때문에 찾아온 거야?","source_cn":"你来找我，是为这个？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FF2D7D5F5CC9C52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1611036104:0":{"text":"내 다리는 나을 수 없어. 그건 모두가 아는 사실이라고.","source_cn":"我的腿伤治不好，这是所有人都知道的事情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF88860E70B659A04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1611036105:0":{"text":"걷지도 못하는 사람에게 그런 질문을 하는 건... 모욕이야.","source_cn":"对一个无法行走的人提出这种问题……是一种羞辱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CCDAAB50AA67546","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1611036106:0":{"text":"네가 자랑하던 기사도 정신 어디 갔어? 아직도 나를 친구로 생각하긴 하는 거니?","source_cn":"你那引以为傲的骑士精神到哪儿去了？你仍然将我视为朋友吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EFBC12BA7D071F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1611036107:0":{"text":"그렇다면 오늘 여기에 오지 말았어야지!","source_cn":"如果是的话，你今天就不该再来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F0CE2E7745F0DC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1611036108:0":{"text":"그로웬, 넌 내 가장 소중한 친구야!","source_cn":"格墨文，你是我最好的朋友！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFC6F4CD2D66D6F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1611036109:0":{"text":"왜 진실을 숨기는지 모르겠지만, 난 네가 잘못된 길로 가지 않기를 바랄 뿐이야.","source_cn":"我不明白你隐瞒真相的理由，可我不想看你在错误的道路上越...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B01D4AB14F62BCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1611036110:0":{"text":"넌 모두를 속였잖아! 심지어 나까지!","source_cn":"你欺骗了我，欺骗了所有人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21E1D508102803EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1611036111:0":{"text":"네가 무슨 자격으로 그런 말을 해?","source_cn":"你没有资格审判我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2973D048CD5D8C7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1611036112:0":{"text":"그래... 자격 없지. 난 그냥 하나만 확인하러 왔을 뿐이야.","source_cn":"……或许吧。我来只是为了确认一件事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAC8FEFBD18CD7E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1611036113:0":{"text":"내가 아는 그로웬은 온화하고 품위 있고, 귀족이지만 절대 거만하지 않은 강한 정신력의 소유자였어.","source_cn":"我所认识的格墨文温和有礼，风度翩翩，出身贵族却从不目中...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72AC88C41ACB43A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1611036114:0":{"text":"지금의 너... 내가 알던 그 그로웬이 맞긴 한 거야? 아니면... 내가 처음부터 진짜 너를 몰랐던 걸까?","source_cn":"现在的你，还是我认识的那个格墨文吗？还是说……我从来都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB95074A3B648E056","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1611036115:0":{"text":"글쎄? 넌 어떻게 생각하는데?","source_cn":"你说呢，休？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A4C00C3DB0E5B73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1611036116:0":{"text":"...잘 모르겠어...","source_cn":"……我不知道。<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF003BC1CB753285","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1611036117:0":{"text":"그게 답이야. 이미 결론을 정해뒀으면서 왜 묻는지 모르겠네.","source_cn":"那就是你的答案。如果你已经有预设好的答案，又何必来问我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EED3137AE080CA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1611036118:0":{"text":"더 이상 할 이야기는 없는 것 같다. ","source_cn":"看来我们没有什么好谈的了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x969406E7846F8262","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1611036119:0":{"text":"잘 가, “내 친구”.","source_cn":"再见……我的朋友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEAD1FF045A52A88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:休":{"text":"실벤","source":"休","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格墨文":{"text":"그로웬","source":"格墨文","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":2}}